# Served by Workers static assets (wrangler.jsonc); the portal Worker passes
# them through on opensource.unisim.co.uk/painter/*.
#
# Content-Security-Policy — what the web app really reaches for, and nothing else:
#   • script-src: its own bundle; the one inline script in index.html (the
#     pre-paint theme, allowed by its sha256 — change the script and the hash
#     must change with it); 'wasm-unsafe-eval' for the HEIC decoder (libheif
#     compiled to WebAssembly, loaded only when an iPhone photo is opened).
#   • style-src 'unsafe-inline': React style attributes, everywhere.
#   • connect-src: the suite changelog and update notice, Supabase (the SDK's
#     client is created even with no accounts; it is never signed in), and
#     data:/blob: for pictures being opened and saved.
#   • worker-src 'self' blob:: the service worker, and the decoder's worker.
#   • img-src: pictures are shown from blob: and data: URLs of the person's own files.
# No analytics, no third-party script.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-UEFMecr75o4NubdvFn6GN7LK14NNoldQ4veq3A1Jjqk=' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' data: blob: https://rygfxgalojojppxmhddo.supabase.co wss://rygfxgalojojppxmhddo.supabase.co https://changelog.unisim.co.uk; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'
